<title>USA: Exide Electronics gets $375 mln USAF order.</title>
<headline>Exide Electronics gets $375 mln USAF order.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exide Electronics Group Inc has been awarded a $375 million order from the U.S. Air Force and other government agencies to provide 372 static uninterruptible power supply systems, the Pentagon said Friday.</p>
</text>
